// The area height this Data view needs (D099): what sits above the Records pane in the area (the pane switch), the pane's other rows
// (head, title row, notices, data bar, pager and re-read line) and the grid's need. Notices are measured as compact as clampNotices
// makes them, in the fixed layout and while the shell scrolls alike, so the answer doesn't depend on which one is showing and the
// shell can't latch into scrolling on the way to a size that fits. A record ID with no admitted row needs its whole "No admitted row"
